                                                "sense_id": "8b37b757-fcaf-3f6f-9d17-1df3079112f3",
                                                "text": "With worrisome patients, it may be in order to predict or prescribe a relapse followed by a rerecovery, a sequence which gives greater confidence in the trustworthiness of the outcome."
